        "OptionC": "It disappeared",
        "OptionD": "It became the Sun",
        "CorrectAnswer": "A",
        "Explanation": "\u0022And that crust then coalesced. It snowballed into a whole separate entity, which we now call the Moon.\u0022 \u2014 01:00"
