      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 15,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "But once we send future astronauts to the lunar surface again, who knows? We may actually have a whole new theory in the coming decades.",
