      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 9,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "So this happened when Earth was just an embryo \u2014 a baby planet,",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "V\u00EC v\u1EADy chuy\u1EC7n n\u00E0y x\u1EA3y ra khi Tr\u00E1i \u0110\u1EA5t m\u1EDBi ch\u1EC9 l\u00E0 m\u1ED9t ph\u00F4i \u2013 m\u1ED9t h\u00E0nh tinh s\u01A1 sinh,",
