        "EndTime": 60
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b2.where-did-our-moon-come-from"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b2.where-did-our-moon-come-from.1e72231ab6644d14a5b165affca8bd38",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 12,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "And that crust then coalesced. It snowballed into a whole separate entity, which we now call the Moon.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "R\u1ED3i l\u1EDBp v\u1ECF \u0111\u00F3 k\u1EBFt t\u1EE5 l\u1EA1i. N\u00F3 l\u1EDBn d\u1EA7n nh\u01B0 qu\u1EA3 c\u1EA7u tuy\u1EBFt th\u00E0nh m\u1ED9t th\u1EF1c th\u1EC3 ri\u00EAng bi\u1EC7t m\u00E0 ng\u00E0y nay ch\u00FAng ta g\u1ECDi l\u00E0 M\u1EB7t Tr\u0103ng.",
        "StartTime": 60,
        "EndTime": 66.9
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b2.where-did-our-moon-come-from"
      }
    },
